AUTHORS
=======

This file credits the people who made this software. Entries are only ever
added, never removed or reordered ahead of the original author.

Original author (BackupLens, the project this is a hard fork of)
----------------------------------------------------------------
Eyyup (Eric) Gunes — creator of BackupLens, copyright holder of the original
work (MIT License). https://github.com/mrgunes/BackupLens
    GitHub: @mrgunes

